## How this file is produced and kept current

This content is the output of the two commands below, filtered to the
resolved dependency graph of `crates/irontraffic` under its default features
(the feature set the default release tarball ships) and grouped by each
package's own declared `license` field:

    cargo metadata --format-version=1
    cargo tree -p irontraffic -e normal --prefix none

Re-run both and regenerate this file's dependency section whenever
`crates/irontraffic/Cargo.toml`'s dependencies change, whenever the shipped
feature set changes, or before cutting a release, whichever comes first. A
NOTICE file that lists yesterday's dependency graph is a claim about a build
this tarball does not contain.
